<title>USA: TABLE - Stolt Comex Seaway Q2 shr profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Stolt Comex Seaway Q2 shr profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended May 31,  1997			  1996</p>
<p> Shr profit	     $  0.62     loss     $  1.28</p>
<p> Net profit		10,441     loss	12,803</p>
<p> Revs		     103,432		   69,882</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,831		   10,000</p>
<p>			6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	     $  0.59     loss     $  2.60</p>
<p> Net profit		 7,922     loss	25,952</p>
<p> Revs		     178,575		  111,710</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,526		   10,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is Stolt Comex Seaway SA.</p>
<p>Company said improved results due to improved market conditions, increased fleet utilization, improved margins and better organization and equipment.</p>
<p>Q2 1996 results were affected by one-time events: grounding of the Seaway Osprey and losses incurred on Yme Beta, together amounting to losses of $13 million, it said.</p>
<p>The company is a subsidiary of Stolt-Nielsen SA.</p>
